<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 12.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 12.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Feb 12	Feb 11     Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  262.700     261.050     247.020    6.35 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  303.900     304.400     306.830   -0.95 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.060     156.365     158.970   -1.83 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.254	46.340	47.182   -1.97 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  429.800     427.500     419.180    2.53 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.090     139.290     141.685   -1.83 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.927	15.929	16.185   -1.59 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  212.140     211.800     212.430   -0.14 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.845	 1.848	 1.888   -2.28 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.555	 1.555	 1.581   -1.64 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  181.975     182.650     183.135   -0.63 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
